  "description": "The AeroSignalR client runtime that generated clients ride on: one-line DI registration with host-lifecycle autostart, initial-connect retry forever, automatic reconnect forever with capped backoff and jitter (recovering even from graceful server closes), access token re-evaluation on every attempt, built-in lifecycle logging, per-invocation timeouts, connection-state health checks, keyed registrations, and clean escape hatches to the underlying HubConnection.",
